@startuml

title PayLink - Payment Lifecycle State Diagram

' ==============================
' DIAGRAM STYLE
' ==============================

left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam state {
    FontName Arial
    FontSize 13
    FontColor #1E293B
    BorderColor #475569
    BackgroundColor #F1F5F9
}

' ==============================
' PAYMENT STATES
' ==============================

state Initiated #DBEAFE
state FundsHeld #FEF3C7
state SentToBiller #FEF3C7
state Unknown #FDE68A

state Completed #BBF7D0
state Rejected #FECACA
state Failed #FECACA
state Refunded #E9D5FF

' ==============================
' INITIAL STATE
' ==============================

[*] --> Initiated

' ==============================
' VALIDATION
' ==============================

Initiated --> FundsHeld : Fraud checks pass\nand sufficient funds available

Initiated --> Rejected : Fraud checks fail\nor insufficient funds

' ==============================
' BILLER PROCESSING
' ==============================

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : Payment request sent

SentToBiller --> Completed : Biller confirms
SentToBiller --> Failed : Biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : Timeout (10 seconds)

' ==============================
' UNKNOWN PAYMENT RESOLUTION
' ==============================

Unknown --> Completed : Later confirmation
Unknown --> Failed : Later refusal or\nreconciliation confirms no payment

' ==============================
' REFUND
' ==============================

Failed --> Refunded : Hold released\nto customer wallet

' ==============================
' FINAL STATES
' ==============================

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

' ==============================
' IMPORTANT BUSINESS RULE
' ==============================

note right of Unknown
  Payment remains pending.
  Funds remain held.

  No automatic refund is allowed
  until the biller's final result
  is confirmed.
end note

note bottom of Refunded
  Completed, Rejected and Refunded
  are final payment states.
end note

@enduml